{"sections":[{"slug":"椭圆曲线的模问题","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"椭圆曲线的模问题"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">椭圆曲线的模问题</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“椭圆曲线的模问题”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>$\\mathbb{C}$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的椭圆曲线由其周期完全刻画</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">给定</span> $H^1(E;\\mathbb{Z})$ <span lang=\"zh\">的一组</span> $\\mathbb{Z}$ <span lang=\"zh\">基</span> $\\alpha,\\beta$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及全纯</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">形式</span> $\\omega\\in\\Gamma(E,\\Omega_E^1)$ (<span lang=\"zh\">这个空间的维数等于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/亏格","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">亏格</span>"}},{"Plain":" $1$), <span lang=\"zh\">积分值</span>\n$$\r\n\\Big[\\int_\\alpha\\omega, \\int_\\beta\\omega\\Big] = [\\omega_1,\\omega_2]\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">生成了</span> $\\mathbb{C}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span> $2$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶格子</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">反之</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">给定格子</span> $\\Lambda$, <span lang=\"zh\">复环面</span> $C / \\Lambda$ <span lang=\"zh\">是一个椭圆曲线</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">将格子</span> $\\Lambda$ <span lang=\"zh\">写为</span> $\\mathbb{Z} + \\mathbb{Z}\\tau$, $\\tau\\in \\mathbb H=\\{z\\in\\mathbb{C}\\colon \\operatorname{im}z&gt;0\\}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是上半平面中的点</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">于是上半平面</span> $\\mathbb H$ <span lang=\"zh\">成为</span> $\\mathbb{C}$ <span lang=\"zh\">上椭圆曲线的参数空间</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">进一步</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">考虑</span> $SL_2(\\mathbb{Z})$ <span lang=\"zh\">作用导致的椭圆曲线的等价关系</span></p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/椭圆曲线的模叠","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">椭圆曲线的模叠</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}